<title>UK: Banco Bandeirantes plans $75 mln Eurobond in 1996.</title>
<headline>Banco Bandeirantes plans $75 mln Eurobond in 1996.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Banco Bandeirantes SA has mandated WestMerchant and Banco Bandeirantes Grand Cayman to jointly lead manage a Eurobond, WestMerchant said in a statement on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The deal is expected to be for $75 million with an eight-year maturity and puts and calls and three and five years, the statement said.</p>
<p>The bond was likely to be launched this year but was subject to Central Bank authorisation which had been applied for, the statement said.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7748</p>
</text>
